"Toth's creature eats only live, unwary, thinking creatures, bipeds by preference."
"If the creature smells fear it kills its prey but will not eat it."
"Toth feeds it villagers lured to his castle with gifts and private meetings."
"Toth is uneasy with the feeding, and forbids that children be fed to it."
"In weeks the creature evolved twice: claws and teleporting, then regrowth and dissolving flesh."
"A guard's sword melted inside the creature, and its skin hardened for a time."
"More evolutions are expected; it may beat any D Grade monster and many C Grades."
"Toth fears the creature's Ring of Control is failing."
"Elasar may hold a master ring that overrides Toth's."
